  "title": "· This Week's New Bags: Hermès's Equestrian-Inspired Kelly II Paddock Retourné 32, Louis Vuitton's Speedy Chain, and Miu Miu's Shearling Wander ·",
  "original_title": "一周新包 | Hermès 马术灵感 Kelly II Paddock Retourné 32 手袋，LV Speedy Chain 链条包，Miu Miu 羊羔毛 Wander 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Hermès updates its Fall/Winter 2026 Kelly with an equestrian-inspired suede Paddock cover featuring exterior pockets and snap closures for practical everyday use.",
