      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For its Fall/Winter 2026 collection, Hermès gives the Kelly a dashing equestrian makeover — the specially designed Paddock cover takes its cue from the blankets draped over horses in show-jumping competitions, complete with functional exterior pockets and snap closures for everyday practicality. Crafted in supple suede and outlined with tonal leather trim along the edges and pockets, it features rounded corners that help distribute the bag's weight, lending the piece a vintage workwear spirit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
