      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k206tc5/162a0c270a9242f4.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton's classic Speedy 20 returns this week in a fresh iteration, still built on Monogram canvas in its compact Boston silhouette and finished with a traditional luggage tag charm. The standout detail is the new sliding-chain shoulder strap, which converts effortlessly between single and double chains. A longer leather-and-chain strap is also included, opening up a range of carrying options — handheld, over the shoulder, or crossbody.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
