    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fuzzy textures continue to rule winter bags, and Miu Miu's new Wander is rendered entirely in soft, fluffy shearling. The body and handles are embroidered with the house's signature Matelassé quilting, creating a look that's both dimensional and refined. The peach-apricot shade blends pink's softness with orange's brightness for a plush, playful feel, while the pristine white version reads like a little snow sprite — ethereal and soothing.",
      "url": null,
